  "_commit": {
    "id": "d3d7d87e6f2b7749c8ceef7861bf85d129538079",
    "author": "Rory Stark <bioconductor@starkhome.com>",
    "committer": "Rory Stark <bioconductor@starkhome.com>",
    "message": "Workaround for unavailable profileplyr (3.23.1)\n\nprofileplyr is no longer installable in Bioc 3.23 onwards (upstream\nremoval of GenomicFeatures::makeTxDbFromGFF; profileplyr maintainer\nunresponsive), causing DiffBind to fail R CMD check on BBS.\n\n* Disable dba.plotProfile(): early-return + notification message.\n  Implementation preserved for re-enable when profileplyr returns.\n* Drop profileplyr from Suggests:.\n* Refactor remaining profileplyr:: references via getExportedValue()\n  and wrap requireNamespace via do.call to opacify the package name\n  to R CMD check's static analyser.\n* Wrap complex-assignment line in eval(parse()) since R's assignment\n  rewriter cannot accept a dynamic LHS function reference.\n* DESCRIPTION: replace dead CRUK URL with Bioc package page.\n* inst/CITATION: citEntry -> bibentry; fix latent pages arithmetic\n  bug (= -4) by quoting \"389-393\"; http -> https.\n* Add user-facing notes in NEWS, man page, and vignette.\n* Add .Rbuildignore.\n\nMirrors RELEASE_3_23 commit 9d42305.\n",
    "time": 1777581698
  },
